    [
     1,
     "That looks great, thanks, and as a bit of a follow up question, is there anyway to determine where the &quot;space&quot; is for each facet grid cell, so that the correlation figure could be put there, rather than having it hard coded.<div><br></div><div>Thanks for the speedy reply.</div>"
